{"id":"cargo","lemma":"cargo","pos":"noun","rank":709,"glosses":["charge, burden","position, post","debit"],"ipa":"/ˈkaɾɡo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cargos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cargo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quién está a cargo aquí?","en":"Who's in charge here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454052","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Ella estará a cargo.","en":"She's going to be in charge.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64418","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"Ambos cargos fueron retirados.","en":"Both charges were withdrawn.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804626","words":[{"g":"both"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"withdrawn, removed","l":"retirado"}]},{"text":"Estoy a cargo de eso.","en":"I'm in charge of that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/556936","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Me haré cargo de tu trabajo.","en":"I'll take over your job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804495","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"work, job"}]}]}